OL,3,AEight killed and at least 17 injured in
OL,4,ANew York building collapse, city's
OL,5,Amayor Mamdani says
OL,6,
OL,7,FRescue efforts are ongoing, as images
OL,8,Fshow dozens of emergency workers
OL,9,Fcontinuing to scour the wreckage
OL,11,FFootage - which you can see at the top
OL,12,Fof this page - shows firefighters
OL,13,Fpulling one survivor out of the debris
OL,14,Fon a stretcher
OL,16,FAn investigation is under way to
OL,17,Festablish what caused the building,
OL,18,Fwhich contained apartments, to suddenly
OL,19,Fcollapse - this map shows where it is
